# NOT YET GENERATED (checked 2026-08-03). These three are the output triple of
# bench/run_topn_sweep.py; the whitelist was added ahead of the run and the run
# has never been committed, so nothing in bench/results/ matches them today.
# Producing them needs the ONNX cross-encoder plus the SPECTER2 embedding cache.
# Kept rather than deleted so the artifacts land in git when someone does the
# run — but do not read these lines as evidence the files exist. Nothing else
# in the repo links to them; tests/test_docs_links.py enforces that.
!bench/results/RERANK_topn_sweep.md
